                                                "sense_id": "5ab4c2c7-c287-3c19-9d0f-40592c00f18e",
                                                "text": "[S]he [Astraea] hath novv an euerlaſting place, / Mongſt thoſe tvvelue ſignes, vvhich nightly vve doe ſee / The heauens bright-ſhining baudricke to enchace; […]"
